Subject: [PATCH 049/110] feat(formula): add interactive step support for
 workflow formulas (#3529)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* feat(formula): add interactive step support for workflow formulas

Steps marked with `interactive = true` in formula TOML are hooked to the
current session instead of being dispatched to a polecat. When any step
in a workflow is interactive, all ready steps stay local.

This enables crew workers to run spec-workflow and other dialogue-heavy
formulas interactively without spawning polecats that block on user input.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

* fix(formula): correct misspelling dialogue → dialog

Fixes CI lint failure (misspell linter).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

